# Everything in this repository is deployed to Linux. The working copies live
# on Windows with core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise check these files
# out with CRLF — and a shell script or a systemd unit with CRLF line endings
# fails on the Pi in ways that read as a syntax error rather than as an
# encoding problem ("syntax error near unexpected token `$'{\r''").
#
# Pin the deployed file types to LF regardless of platform.
*.sh        text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.service   text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.txt       text eol=lf
Dockerfile  text eol=lf
